<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Waloma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Walo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Waloma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa Waloma</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Waloma</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Kukihitabu kya Waloma inguwesekana kiyandikwa na mndumindumi Paulo lipindi lya paghati gha machuva 54 na 58 badili gha kuwelekwa Kilisito. Paulo awelili kambila kuyenda ku Loma kwa nagha akatumila lihamba hali kuwapegha malaghilo wakilisito vila wangupalwa kulama wakilisito wa Loma, Wayahudi na wala wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi weni kulikala kumlima wa Loma. Ayandikili lihamba hali kuhuma mmbwani wa Kolintu kula awelili kalikala lipindi lila. Paulo ayayandikilili hagha milima hyogha wapati kumkwinila na kumtundamila Yesu Kilisito 16:26</para>
  <para style="ip">Kihitabu kya Waloma ni kihitabu maha kwa wakilisito kila mahala na kila lipindi kwaikiva Paulo kayandika kwa njila gha lipala kunani gha ulokola tunguwesa kupokela kwa njila gha Yesu Kilisito. Paulo hilahila angukonganisa Habali Maha gha Yesu na lilaghanu lya dahile. Wasoma watangala wangujumila yiwa musitali 1:16 yiwa ni mghomba kukihitabu hula weni kulonga, “Mweni kujumilwa na Sapanga atelikala kwa ukwinila: Mtumbulo kwa Wayahudi na kangi kwa wandu wa milima hyogha.” Mahala kwa mtumbulo kukihitabu kya Waloma sula gha 1-12 ingulongelela kwa utali umanyi wa Sapanga na mbandi gha ipili sula gha 13-15 ingulongelela malaghilo yatangala vila wakilisito wangupalwa walami.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati:</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo atumbulili lihamba lyaki kwa kujimanyisa mweni na kulonga ni ghani angumyandikila sula 1:1-15</para>
  <para style="io">Hinu Paulo angulonga ulungwana na uwesekano wa kulokoka kupitila Yesu Kilisito sula 1:16-11:36</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi Paulo anguwapegha wakilisito malaghilo gha vitendu kungalilu gha kikilisito sula 12:1-15:13</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo anguyomola kihitabu kya Waloma kwa kuwajambusa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lya haku Loma sula 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Nenga Paulo, mtumikila wa Kilisito Yesu na mndumindumi nihaghulilwi na kukemwa kwaikiva gha kutangasa Habali Maha gha Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Habali hai Maha ndiwa hila Sapanga awalaghilili wandu kuhuma dahile kupitila walota kumayandiko ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Hai Habali Maha ingumlongelela Mwana wa Sapanga, Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito, avile kwa umundu ghaki, awelili muwelekwa kuukolu wa Daudi, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />na kwa uweso wa Mpumulo wa Sapanga, ahighilisilwi kuwela Mwana wa Sapanga kupitila uhinduki ghaki kuhuma kukihu. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Kwa njila ghaki Yesu, Sapanga anipeghili manemu gha kuvile mndumindumi ili nilongose milima hyogha ipati kumkwinila na kumtundamila, na kwa tendu hali lihina lyaki lipati kuyinuliwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Mwenga wogha hila hila ni paghati gha wandu wakemilwi ili mpati kuwela wandu ghaki Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Hinu, ninguwayandikila mwenga wogha mvile ku Loma wenikuwela wangupalwa na Sapanga, akawahaghula muweli wandu ghaki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Ninguwayupila kwa Sapanga Tati na kwa Bambu Yesu Kilisito awapeghi manemu na kulikala kwa kuponga.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mayupo gha kushukwile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Mtumbulo gha hyogha, ningumshukwile Sapanga wa nenga kwa njila gha Yesu Kilisito kwaikiva gha mwenga wogha, kwaikiva wandu wogha kumlima wogha wayoghanila ukwinila wa mwenga. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Sapanga yula ningumtumikila kwa moyu ghangu wogha kukutangasa Habali Maha gha Mwana ghaki, angumanya ningulonga uchakaka yiwa ninguwakumbwike <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />lipindi lyogha paniyupa. Ninguluwa Sapanga kumapalo ghaki, aniwesesi kuhika kwa mwenga. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Nivile na luhujulu lwa kuwatyangila ili niwatangi kughalilu gha mwenga gha kimpumulo, ili muwesi kugangamala kuukwinila, <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />ingumaanisa, mwenga mnitayi moyu kuukwinila ghangu na nenga niwatayi moyu kuukwinila wa mwenga.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Walongo ghangu, ningupala mmanyi yiwa mianja itangala nivikili lukani kuhika kwa mwenga, ila mbaka hinaa kuvili ma mghalu ungunikanisa. Ningupala kuhuma kwa mwenga niwaghole wandu wamkwinili Kilisito handa nigholili ku Wayahudi ng'ogha. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Kwaikiva ningupalwa kuwayendela huti wandu wogha. Wagiliki na wala Wagiliki ng'ogha, weni luhala na wala wavile ng'ogha na luhala kuwatangasila Habali Maha. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ndiwa kwaikiva ningupala nesu kutangasa Habali Maha hilahila kwa mwenga mvile ku Loma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habali Maha gha Kilisito iwela na makakala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Nenga nivile ng'ogha na honi kutangasa Habali Maha, kwaikiva hai ivile na uwesa wa Sapanga weni kuyegha ulokola kwa kila mweni kukwinila, kwa Myahudi mtumbulo na kwa Mgiliki hila hila. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Kwaikiva Habali Maha ingulangiha lipala yiwa Sapanga anguwaghola wajumiliki kuulongolo ghaki kwa njila gha kukwinila, kuhuma mtumbulo mbaka kumwihu, handa iyandikwa ku Mayandiko, “Mweni kujumilwa na Sapanga atelikala kwa ukwinila.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilaka lya Sapanga kwa wandu weni mahakata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Lilaka lya Sapanga lihighiliswa Kuhuma kundumba kunani gha uhyuka na uhakata wogha wa wandu wenikuwela kwa njila zyau zihakata wanguungingama uchakaka ukotoho kumanyikana. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />kwaikiva mghalu hyogha yeni kuwesa kumanyikana kumlongelela Sapanga ni lipala kwa weni, kwaikiva Sapanga mweni kalivika lipala kwa weni. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Pamonga na yiwa alumbili mlima wogha, uwesa ghaki wa machuwa yayendelela na ulungu ghaki, pamonga na yiwa viwoneka ng'ogha kwa mihu, vingumanyika lipala. Wandu wanguwesa kumanya mighalu hai kukovekelana na vindu havi alumbili Sapanga. Kwa nagha wavile ng'ogha na njila yoyosi gha kulitetela. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Pamonga na yiwa wammanyili Sapanga, wamtundamila ng'ogha handa Sapanga wala kumshukwile, ila mawachilo ghao yawelili yabyodoka na mioyu ghao gha undyungi itayilwi lwisa wakawesa ng'ogha kumanya ujumbi wa Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Wangulikwinisa yiwa weni luhala, ila ni wandyungi. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Badili gha kumyupa Sapanga mweni kulikala machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, ila wahyukila kuyupa ming'omung'omu yeni kugholwa na wandu mweni kulikala ng'ogha machuwa hyogha bila mwihu na mlandano wa mbongo, mikokolo na viumbi vya kukwava. <verse eid="ROM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Kwaikiva gha nagha, Sapanga kawaleka wakovekeli lumatamata lwao luhakata lwa mioyu ghao na kugholana mighalu gha honi ku mihigha ghao. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Waleka kukwinila uchakaka wa Sapanga wakakovekela uhwangi, wakatundamila na kutumikila viumbi badili gha Mulumba, avile ndiwa angupalwa kutundamilwa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu! Hina. <verse eid="ROM 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Kwa nagha, Sapanga akawaleka wakovekeli lumatamata luhakata. Hata wadala wahyukile kutumila mihigha ghao handa Sapanga aipalile. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Na hagha walumi hilahila, wakaleka kukovekela vila wangupalwa kugholelana wangwana na wahumbu, wakawonelana luhujulu weni kwa weni. Walumi wakagholana mighalu gha honi, na nagha wangujiyeghela wenibaha kunyokolwa kwa vitendu vya weni vihakata. <verse eid="ROM 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Kwaikiva wandu wakanili kummanya Sapanga, Sapanga akawaleka wakovekeli kumawachilo ghao mahakata, wakaghola ghala yavile wapalilwi ng'ogha kughola. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Wandu hagha wamemeswa matendu mahakata, wamema uwonefu, lumatamata luhakata na lumatamata lwa kila kindu kiweli kya wenga. Kulolelana wifu, kukomana, magombi, kungongana, mawachilo mahakata. Weni hilahila ni weni kulongelela milandu gha wandu, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />na weni kukupikilana na wandu weni kumpala ng'ogha Sapanga, na weni kinyengu na utatala na mikwinakwina na weni uhakata na weni kulema kuwayitikila watati na wanyongo ghao, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />wandyungi, wangutimilisa ng'ogha kila wangukilongela, wavile ng'ogha na upalo na luhungu kwa waghangi. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Wangumanya yiwa selia gha Sapanga ingulonga yiwa wandu weni ndyangilu handa hai, wangupalwa kuhova, pamonga na kuvile na liyandiko hali weni wangughola hagha na ngulu gha hagha, wangujumilana na wala weni kughola hagha.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Ulamulo wa chakaka wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Hinu, ghanja, handa unguwalamula waghangi, katu utewesa ng'ogha kulitetela, pamonga na yiwa wenga kwa ghani. Kwaikiva, kwa kuwalamula waghangi, ungujilamula mwenibaha kwa vila na wenga ungughola mighalu hai hai unguwalamula wayako. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Hinu tungumanya yiwa lamulo lya Sapanga ni lya chakaka pala paawalamula wandu handa hagha. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Ila wenga ghanja unguwalamula wala wangughola mighalu handa hai na kunu wenga kangi ungughola hai hai, ghuli unguliwachila yiwa utehyeta lamulo lya Sapanga? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Au unguupughanya ulungwana ghaki utangala, kutama nuu kwaki Sapanga na kufumilila kwaki, wenga umanya ng'ogha yiwa ulungwana ghaki unguwesa kukutaya moyu ili kuulongolo uhyuki na uleki sambi? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ila kwaikiva gha ungakatalu wa moyu gha wenga hula upala ng'ogha kuleka sambi, ungujidilundikila mnyokulu kwa lichuwa lila lya ulamulo lipindi ulamula wa haki pauhighiliswa. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Lichuwa hali Sapanga atempegha kila mmonga kukovekelana na angupalwa kupokela. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Wala weni kuyendelela kughola matendu gha ulungwana na kuhakula kutundamilwa nesu kuhuma kwa Sapanga, na kupokela ukomu weni kuwela ng'ogha na mwihu. Na mweni Sapanga atewapegha ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Ila kwa wala watekovekela mighalu ghao weni baha, waleka chakaka gha Sapanga na kukovekala njila zihakata, kutevile na mnyokolu na lilaka kwa weni kuhuma kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Hila hila kutewela na mahakilo na lung'ai vitemkola kila yula mweni kughola mahakata, Myahudi atewela wa mtumbulo na kuulongolo atekovekela Mgiliki. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Ila kila wandu wangughola ulungwana Sapanga atewapegha ujumilo, utundamilu na kulikala kwa kuponga, watetumbula Wayahudi, hinu wandu wa milima ghangi hilahila. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Kwaikiva Sapanga kawela ng'ogha na ubaghula. <verse eid="ROM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Kwaikiva wandu wogha waigholile sambi lipindi wavile ng'ogha na selia gha Sapanga ampeghili Musa wateyalamiswa panji gha hali selia, na wala wagholile sambi lipindi lya selia gha Sapanga ampeghili Musa na weni wakatenyula watelamulwa kupitila hai selia. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Kwaikiva ng'ogha wala wanguyitikila selia gha Sapanga ampeghili Musa ndiwa watewela walungwana kuulongolo gha Sapanga, ila ni wala wangutundamila selia ndiwa watevalangilwa yiwa walungwana. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi wamanyile ng'ogha selia ila pala pawagholile mighalu maha kwa kulongoswa na mioyu ghao na mighalu hai ni handa selia ingupala hagha wangutimilisa selia vila ingupala. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Kuzyowelela kwao kungulangiha yiwa lila lipalwa kugholeka vila selia ingupala liyandikwa kumioyu ghao. Uwesa ghao wa kulamula kughola ghamaha au mahakata lipindi ghangi yanguwalamula, na lipindi ghangi yanguwatetela. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Ndiwa itewela lipindi lya ulamulo, pavile Sapanga kwa njila gha Kilisito Yesu, atetosa wandu kwa mawachilo ghao gha mkifisu. Habali Maha ninguitangasa ndiwa ingulongela.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi na Selia gha Sapanga ampeghili Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Ila wenga ungujikema Myahudi na unguhyagamila selia gha Sapanga ampeghili Musa na kuitutumulilila Sapanga, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />hilahila unguyamanya ghala Sapanga angupala, na unguijumila mighalu ivile maheli, na wenga uvulilwi kupitila selia, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />hilahila wenga unguitutumula yiwa kwa kilongosi wa wangali mihu, na kwa mhana kwa wala weni kuwela mlwisa. <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />Na wenga unguilola kwa mvula wa wandyungi na mvula wa wavile wasoma ng'ogha. Uvile na mavulo gha chakaka kuhai selia, <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Hinu, wenga unguwavula waghangi, Kwa kyani uwesa ng'ogha kuivula mweni baha? Unguwatangasila waghangi wakotoho kuhija, ila wenga mweni unguhija? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Ungulonga, “Mkotoho kughola ngongola,” na kunu wenga ungughola ngongola unguhyomela ming'omung'omu gha milungu ila ungulighola uweli mnaisa kwa kuhija kumaghuta gha Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Wenga mweni kuighola yiwa ungumanya selia zya Sapanga ghuli ungulola ng'ogha yiwa ungumlighu Sapanga? kwa kukotoho kukovekela vila selia ingupala. <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Handa iyandikwa, “Kwaikiva gha mwenga, lihina lya Sapanga lingulighwa paghati gha wandu wa milima.” <verse eid="ROM 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Kuyingiswa jandu kwa maha ikiva unguyitikila Selia, ila ikiva ungutenyula Selia, kuyingiswa jandu kwa wenga kutewela yaghi yaghi. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Ikiva mundu Myahudi ng'ogha mweni kuyingiswa jandu ng'ogha, na angukola selia, ghuli Sapanga atemvalangila ng'ogha yiwa kayingiswa jandu? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Ndiwa wala Wayahudi ng'ogha wavile kihigha wayingiswa ng'ogha jandu ila wangughola vila selia ingulonga watewalamula mwenga Wayahudi, mvile myingiswa jandu na kuimanya nesu selia gha Sapanga ila muighola ng'ogha. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Ng'ogha kila mundu mweni kuwelekwa na Myahudi atewela mundu wa Sapanga. Kwa nagha mundu anguwesa ng'ogha kuwoneka yiwa kamundu wa Sapanga kwa kuyingiswa jandu. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Ila mundu wa Sapanga ni yula mwenikuyitikila kwa Mpumulo. Kuyingiswa nandu kwa chakaka kungugholwa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga kumoyu. Ng'ogha kwa kukola selia mundu hayu kangupokela ng'ogha sifa kwa wandu ila kuhuma kwa Sapanga mweni.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Hinu, Myahudi kana liki kupiti wandu ghangi? Au kuyingiswa jandu kuvile na fwaida liki? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Hina kuvili na fwaida kunjila zitangala. Kwaikiva Sapanga ahaghulile kuwapegha Wayahudi ujumbi ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Ila itewela ghuli ikiva amonga ghao wawelili ng'ogha wachakaka? Ghuli, Sapanga atewela ng'ogha mchakaka kwa kila angupalwa kukighola? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Katu! Sapanga atewela mchakaka machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, pamonga na yiwa kila mundu kamuhwangi. Handa Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">“Kila paulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">ungulonga chakaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">na kukulamula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">wenga ungusinda.” <verse eid="ROM 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Ila kwa njila gha mahakata ghala tungughola, Sapanga anguwoneka kuwela ni mweni haki, ghuli tulongi Sapanga angukosela paatunyokola? Ningulongela kwa mawachilo gha kimundu. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Katu! Ikiva ingaliwela nagha, Sapanga angaliwesaghuli kulamula wandu? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Mundu anguwesa kukonya, handa uhwangi wa nenga ungutanga kuwonesa chakaka gha Sapanga na kuyongesa ukwilikihi ghaki, kwa kyani hinu nenga ningulamulwa yiwa mweni sambi? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Hai ni handa na kulongela,“Tuweli tukighola sambi ili yahiki gha maha.” Wandu waghangi tukupikila yiwa hata twenga tunguvula handa nagha. Uloli, hagha wogha watanyokolwa kukovekelana na mahakata ghao.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwahela mundu kawoneka mmaha kwa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Hinu tunguwesa kulonga liki? Ghuli, twenga Wayahudi ni wamaheli kupiti waghangi? Hata mayaghani. Kwaikiva nilangiha kala yiwa Wayahudi na Wayahudi ng'ogha wogha wavile na sambi. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Handa Mayandiko yangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">“Kwahela hata mundu mmonga mweni kuwela mmaha kuulongolo gha Sapanga, <verse eid="ROM 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />kwahela mundu mweni umanyi wa chakaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">kwahela hata mmonga mweni kupala kumyupa Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Wogha wabyodoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">kwahela mweni kughola gha maha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">kwa hela mweni kughola ulungwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">kwahela hata mmonga.” <verse eid="ROM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Milando mihakata inguhuma kumilomo ghao handa mnungilo mhakata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">Na weni wangungonga wandu machuwa hyogha na kuwaghola watili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">Milando ghao inguwahakila wandu handa sumu gha njoka ingughola. <verse eid="ROM 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Milando ghao imema vilapo vikalipa kwa waghangi na kuwahakila. <verse eid="ROM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Wandu hagha wanguloposela kuhakila na kukoma waghangi, <verse eid="ROM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Kokosi wanguyenda wangukologhanya na kuyalamisa na kuwaleka wandu wakiwela na unyengemalu. <verse eid="ROM 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Njila gha kulikala kwa kuponga waimanya ng'ogha. <verse eid="ROM 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />“Wavile ng'ogha na utundamilo kwa Sapanga.” <verse eid="ROM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Hinu, tungumanya yiwa chochose kilongelwa na laghilo lya Sapanga ampeghili Musa, kinguwalongela wala weni kulongoswa na laghilo ili kukotoho kuwela na wakulitetela lipindi wandu wa mlima wogha pawalamulwa na Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Kwa nagha kwahela mundu hata mmonga atewoneka wamaha kuulongolo gha Sapanga kwa matendu gha selia, kwaikiva selia ingutughola tumanyi sambi weka.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujumilwa na Sapanga kwa kumkwinila Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Ila hinaa, njila gha Sapanga gha kuwajumila wandu kuwela wa maha kuulongolo ghaki ihighiliswa kala, bila kuhyaghamila selia. Selia na Walota wanguhighilisa mghalu hau. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Haku kujumilwa na Sapanga kunguhika kupitila kumkwinila Yesu Kilisito kwa wala wogha wamkwinila kwaikiva kwahela mlekanu wowosi paghati gha Myahudi na Wayahudi ng'ogha, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />wandu wogha wagholile sambi na kulepelelwa kughola kila akipalile Sapanga wagholi. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Ila wangujumilika kuulongolo gha Sapanga kwa ulungwana ghaki Sapanga kwa njila gha Kilisito Yesu yula atuvikili tuweli pekesu kuhuma kusambi tusighola. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Sapanga kamhumisa Yesu lukani, kwa mwahi ghaki, aweli njila gha kuwahumisila wandu sambi syau kwa ukwinila ghao kwa mweni. Agholile nagha ili apati kulangiha yiwa mweni ni mlungwana. Haku dahile Sapanga awelili angufumilila bila kuziwachilila sambi sya wandu. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Agholili nagha ili kuwonesa uchakaka nesu lipindi hali, kwa kuwaghola wandu wajumiliki kwa mweni wandu wala weni kumkwinila Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Hinu, tunguwesa kujitutumulila kyani? Kwa hela. Kwa kyani? Ghuli, kwaikiva gha kutimilisa selia? Ng'ogha. Ila. Kwa ikiva tungukwinila. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Kwaikiva twalola yiwa Sapanga kamjumila ng'ogha mundu kuwela mlungwana kwa kutimilisa selia ila kwa kumkwinila Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Ghuli, Sapanga ni Sapanga wa Wayahudi wekayao? Ghuli, mweni ng'ogha Sapanga wa wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi hilahila? Hina, mweni ni Sapanga wa wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi hilahila. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Kwaikiva kuvile na Sapanga mmonga hela. Na ni mweni atewavalanga Wayahudi na wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi kujumilwa kuulongolo ghaki kwa njila gha kukwinila kwa kila mmonga. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Hinu tunguwesa kulonga kwaikiva gha kukwinila tunguwesa kubadilisa selia? Katu hata mayaghani. Ila tunguitimilisa Selia.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Hinu tulonge kyani kulongelela tati wa twenga Ibulahimu? Awesaghuli kumanya vila mundu kangujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Ikiva Ibulahimu ajumilililwi kwa matendu ghaki, hinu, avile na kindu kya kulidumbila ila ng'ogha kuulongolo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Kwaikiva Mayandiko gha Sapanga yalongile, “Ibulahimu amkwinilili Sapanga na Sapanga akamjumila.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Mghola lihengu anguhipwa msahala, msahala ghaki ng'ogha hupo ila anguhipwa kila angupalwa kuhipwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Ila mundu mweni kuliwachila ng'ogha yiwa matendu ghaki yangumtanga, badili ghaki angumkwinila Sapanga yula mweni kuwajumila wandu wahakata, kukwinila kwaki mundu hayu ivalangililwa yiwa ni wa chakaka. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Daudi hila hila alongili nagha nagha paalongili habali zya highili kwa mundu yula avile Sapanga angumjumilila, akileka kuvalanga matendu ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Wahighilwa wala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">wavile uwakata wau ulekeselwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">wavile sambi zyao zihumiswa. <verse eid="ROM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Kahighilwa mundu yula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:8">avile Sapanga kavika ng'ogha ngumbungumbu gha sambi zyaki.” <verse eid="ROM 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Ghuli, haku kuhighilwa ni kwa wala wayingiswa jandu wekayao, au na kwa wala wayingiswa ng'ogha jandu? Tungulonga, “Ibulahimu akwinilili, na mweni Sapanga akamjumila.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Ghuli, Ibulahimu ajumilililwi pambila gha kuyingiswa jandu, au badili gha kuyingiswa jandu? Pambila gha kuyingiswa jandu, na ng'ogha badili gha kuyingiswa jandu. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ibulahimu ayingisilwi jandu kuulongolo, na kuyingiswa jandu haku kuwelili ni kilangihi kyeni kuhighilisa yiwa Sapanga amjumilili kuwela mweni ulungwana kwaikiva gha ukwinila ghaki hula awelili nau pambila gha kuyingiswa jandu. Kwa nagha Ibulahimu kawela tati wa wala wogha weni kukwinila pamonga na yiwa wayingiswa ng'ogha jandu, wamkwinila Sapanga, wakajumilwa na Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Hilahila mweni ni tati wa wala wayingiswa jandu kwa kukwinila, ikiva wangumkwinila Sapanga. Ila ng'ogha kwaikiva gha kuyingiswa jandu, ila ni kwaikiva gha kukovekela njila hila hila gha kukwinila vila tati wa twenga Ibulahimu aikovekelili pambila gha kuyingiswa jandu.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alongile Sapanga lingutimiliswa kwa kukwinila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Sapanga amlaghilili Ibulahimu na wawelekwa ghaki yiwa mlima wogha ungaliwela wa weni. Lilaghano hali ligholwa ng'ogha kwaikiva Ibulahimu ayitikilili selia, ila kwaikiva akwinilili, akajumilwa kuwela mlungwana. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Handa alongile Sapanga ni kwa wala weni kuyitikila selia gha Sapanga ampeghili Musa, hinu ukwinila utevile ng'ogha na samani yoyosi, na hagha alongile Sapanga ni yaghi yaghi. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Selia ndiwa ingughola wandu wanyokolwe na Sapanga, hinu papawela ng'ogha na selia kutewela ng'ogha na lilaka kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Kwa nagha, akilongile Sapanga kinguhika kwa njila gha ukwinila, hinu mghalu hau unguwela nagha kwa kupitila ulungwana wa Sapanga, na ni chakaka kilongelwa haki ni kwaikiva gha wandu wogha: ng'ogha kwa wala weka weni kukola selia, ila hilahila kwa wala weni kulama kwa ukwinila handa Ibulahimu. Avile ni tati wa twenga wogha. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Handa iyandikilwi, “Nikughola wenga kuwela tati wa milima mitangala.” Mghalu hau uwelili maha kumihu gha Sapanga, yula akwinililwi na Ibulahimu, Sapanga mweni kuwapegha wandu ukomu, na kuvika vindu vila viwela ng'ogha vikawela. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Abulahamu pakalongelwa mighalu hai iwelili yuyughu ng'ogha kukwinila ila ayendelelili kukwinila na kutumainila yiwa Sapanga atemghola kuwela tati wa milima itangala, kwaikiva Sapanga awelili kamlongela Ibulahimu, “Utewela na uwelekwa utangala handa ndondwa.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Abulahamu lipindi hali awelili mgogolo wa machuva yahika imia imonga, ila ukwinila ghaki usisila ng'ogha pamonga na yiwa amanyilli yiwa higha ghaki iwelili handa kahova, na hilahila mhumbu ghaki Sala, awelili kawesa ng'ogha kukola ndumbu kwaikiva gha ugogolo. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Ila Abulahamu avikili ng'ogha holu kwa kila alongelilwi na Sapanga, ila ayendelelili kuwela na makakala kuukwinila na kumuyinula Sapanga, <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />kunu Abulahamu akiwela na uhighilisu yiwa Sapanga kana uweso wa kughola lila amlongelili. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Hai ndiwa njila, “Imgholile Sapanga amjumili Abulahamu kuulongolo ghaki yiwa kammaha.” <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Pailongwa, “Kamjumila,” ilongwa ng'ogha kwaikiva gha mweni weka yaki hela. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />ila mghalu hau ungutulongela twenga hilahila tuvile tungumkwinila Sapanga yula amuhindulili Yesu, Bambu wa twenga, kuhuma kukihu. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Yesu ahumisilwi ahovi kwaikiva gha sambi zyetu, na mweni ahindukili kwaikiva gha twenga ili tujumiliki kuulongolo gha Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Kuwela waghanja wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Kwa nagha, kwaikiva tujumilwa kala kwa ukwinila, tungulikala kwa kuponga na Sapanga kupitila Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Kwa njila gha kumkwinila Yesu, Sapanga katupatila umaha ghaki hata hinaa tunguyendelela kupokela umaha hau, tunguhekelela nesu kwaikiva tungutumainila yiwa tutelikala na Sapanga kundumba. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Hina, ng'ogha hai hela, hata patuwela kulung'ai tukimanya yiwa lung'ai lungututanga kuwela wafumilifu, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />na ufumilifu ndiwa wenikutuyeghela kukotoho kutila na kukotoho kutila kungutuyeghela litumaini. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Litumaini hali liwesa ng'ogha kutuvika mhoni, kwaikiva Sapanga katuyitila kala kumioyu gha twenga upalo ghaki kwa njila gha Mpumulo ghaki yula atupeghili. <verse eid="ROM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Kwaikiva hata patuwelili tuvile ng'ogha na mtanga wowosi, lipindi palihika, Kilisito ahovili kwaikiva gha twenga tuvile na sambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Uchakaka ni yiwa yuyughu ng'ogha mundu kuhova ili kumtetela mundu mweni kujumilika kuulongolo gha Sapanga, ila mundu anguwesa kuyesa kuhova kwaikiva gha mundu maha. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Ila Sapanga atulangilile yiwa angutupala nesu, kwaikiva lipindi patuwelili twambila weni sambi, Kilisito ahovili kwaikiva gha twenga. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Hinu, kwaikiva hinaa tungujumilika kuulongolo gha Sapanga kwa mwahi ghaki, ni chakaka nesu tutelokolwa kuhuma kulilaka lya Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Lipindi patuwelili wahakata wa Sapanga akatughola tuweli maghanja na mweni kwa kupitila kihu kya Mwana ghaki, na handa tugholwa kuwela waghanja ghaki hinu tungumanya atetulokola Kilisito atetulokola kwaikiva mweni ni mkomu machuwa hyogha. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Ila ng'ogha hagha hela, hilahila tunguhekelela kwa kila Sapanga kakighola kupitila Bambu Yesu Kilisito, pala pakatughola tujumilwe na Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Kwa nagha handa vila sambi iyingilili kumlimawogha kupitila kwa mundu mmonga na sambi hagha ikalandala yegha kihu. Kwaikiva wandu wogha waghola sambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Pambila gha selia gha Sapanga ampeghili Musa, sambi iwelili mumlimawogha, Sapanga ailongile ng'ogha yiwa wandu wawela na sambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Hata nagha, kuhuma lipindi lya Adamu mbaka lipindi lya Musa, kihu kikawela nkosi ghao wandu wogha pamonga na hata wala waghola ng'ogha sambi handa hila gha Adamu gha kumyitikila ng'ogha Sapanga, Adamu awelili mlandanu wa yula atehika. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Sambi gha Adamu ilingulandine ng'ogha na ulungwana wa Sapanga. Adamu ni mundu mmonga mwenikughola wandu wogha wahovi kukovekelana na sambi ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Kangi vila Sapanga anguwalekesela wandu kwa ulungwana ghaki kungulandine ng'ogha na ghala yenikuyeghwa na sambi gha Adamu. Sambi hila imonga gha Adamu paigholokile Sapanga akawanyokola wandu wogha. Ila hinaa sambi zitangala zigholeka ila Sapanga kambila kanguwajumila wandu kwa njila gha ulungwana ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Chakaka, kwa sambi gha mundu mmonga, akayambusa kihu kutumbula unkosi, ni lipala nesu yiwa kila akigholile hayu Kilisito ni maha nesu, wandu wogha wenikupokela ulungwana hau wenikuwela ni hupo gha kujumilwa kuulongolo ghaki watewela wankosi kupitila Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Kwa nagha, ulamula wa Sapanga uwahikilile wandu wogha kwaikiva gha uhakata mmonga augholile Adamu. Ila tendu limonga aligholile Kilisito liwavika wandu kuwela pekesu. Hinu Sapanga anguwajumila wandu kwa njila gha tendu limonga aligholile Kilisito. Na kwa nagha wandu wangupokela ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Na hilahila wandu wogha wawonekanili yiwa wawela na sambi kwa hayu mundu mmonga kukotoho kumyitikila Sapanga, hilahila kwa Yesu kamyitikila Sapanga pala ahweghili kulipingika akaghola wandu watangala kujumilwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Ila selia iyingilili ili wandu wawesi kulola vila wagholile sambi. Ila wandu pawagholile sambi nesu Sapanga akayendelela kuwela mmaha kwa wandu kwa njila zitangala nesu. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Handa vila sambi ilandalile na kuyegha kihu, hilahila umaha wa Sapanga uyendelela kuwela mtangala na kuyegha ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, kwa kupitila Yesu Kilisito Bambu wa twenga.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Ukomu kukonganika na Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Tulonge kyani hinu? Ghuli, tuyendeleli kughola sambi ili manemu gha Sapanga yapati kuyongeseka? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Katu iwesekana ng'ogha. Lula lumatamata lwa kughola sambi mghati gha twenga luhovile, tutewesaghuli kuyendelela kughola sambi? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Mmanyang'ogha yiwa twenga wogha tuwelili tubatiswa ku Kilisito Yesu tubatisilwi na kukongana na kukihu kyaki? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Patubatisilwi tukonganili na kihu kyaki, tukasikwa pamonga na mweni, ili handa vila Kilisito kahindulwa kuhuma kukihu kwa kitendu kikulu kya Tati, hilahila na twenga tupati kulikala ngalilu hyonu. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Ikiva, twenga tukonganikili na mweni kukihu, hilahila tutekongana na mweni kwa kuhinduliwa kuhuma kukihu handa mweni. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Kwaikiva tungumanya yiwa hula umundu wa twenga wa dahile uvambilwi mulupingika pamonga na Kilisito, lukani tukotoho longoswa kangi na sambi na kuwela na uhusutu wa sambi. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Kwaikiva mundu yoyose pakahova anguwela pekesu kutali na sambi. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Hinu ikiva tuhovili pamonga na Kilisito, tungukwinila yiwa tutelama kangi pamonga na mweni. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Kwaikiva tungumanya yiwa Kilisito kahindulwa kala kuhuma kukihu na atehova ng'ogha kangi, kihu kitewela ng'ogha na unkosi kangi kwa mweni. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Hinu, kwaikiva ahovili lihanja limonga hela, sambi iwela ng'ogha na makakala kangi kwa mweni, na hinaa angulikala kuukonganiko na Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Hila hila na mwenga mngupalwa mujivalangi mhova kwa yala yangulongela sambi ila mliloli yiwa mngulikala kuukonganiko na Sapanga, kupitila Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Hinu, mkotoho ileka sambi iweli kindu kikulu nesu kumihigha gha mwenga na kuyitikila lumatamata lwaki luhakata. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Hila hila mkotoho kuleka mihigha gha mwenga ikawela kyombu kya kughola mahakata na sambi. Kihyetu na hagha, mjiyeghi weni kwa Sapanga handa wandu kahuma kukihu na kuyingila kuukomu, na mtumili higha handa kyombu kya kughola yala gha maha kwa ukwilikihi wa Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Ila sambi itewela ng'ogha na unkosi kangi kwa mwenga, kwaikiva muwela ng'ogha pahi gha selia gha Sapanga ampeghili Musa, ila hinaa mngukala kuulungwana wa Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ungupalwa kughola ghamaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Hinu tulongi kyani? Ghuli sambi iyendeleli kuwela na unkosi kunani gha twenga? Kwaikiva tuvile ng'ogha pahi gha selia ila pahi gha manemu gha Sapanga? Katu hata mayaghani! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Chakaka mwenga mngumanya yiwa pamtangana mwenga maweni handa wahusutu na kumyoghanila mundu mtenu. Mwenga mnguwela wahusutu kwa hayu mungumyoghanila. Pamlihumisa kuwelam wahusutu wa sambi mtehova, ila pamuwela wahusutu wa kumjumila Sapanga mtejumilwa kuulongolo ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Pamonga na yiwa muwelili wahusutu wa sambi haku dahile, hinaa ningumshukwile Sapanga kwaikiva muwela wayitikila kwa mioyu gha mwenga hyogha kwa mavulo mpeghilwi. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Ningumshukwile Sapanga kwaikiva kawapegha upekesu ili mkotoho kuwela wahusutu wa sambi, akaghola muweli handa wahusutu ghaki ili mgholi mighalu yeni kumhekelesa. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Ningutumila luga gha uhusutu ili iweli handa mlandano kwa wenga upati kumanya, kwaikiva gha ulepelelu wa mwenga. Handa vila haku mtumbulo pamyitikila kulongoswa na mighalu mihakata, ila hinaa mngupalwa mlihumisi mwenga maweni kughola ghala anguyapala Sapanga, ili muweli watumikila ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Pamuwelili wahusutu wa sambi muwela ng'ogha mkighola ghala awelile akipala Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Hinu mpokelili fwaida liki kwa mighalu hila mgholili kukovekelana na mighalu hila mnguiwonela honi hinaa? Kwaikiva mwihu gha hagha ni kihu. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Ila hinaa mkombolwa kuhuma kuuhusutu wa sambi na muwela watumikila wa Sapanga, fwaida muwela nayu hinaa ni kughululwa na kupokela ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Kwaikiva mahipo gha sambi ni kihu, ila fwaida gha Sapanga ni ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu ku Kilisito Yesu Bambu wa twenga.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Mlandano kuhuma kundowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Walongo ghangu, ningumanya yiwa mungumanya chakaka hagha mbala kulongela kwa mwenga, kwaikiva mwenga ni wandu weni kumanya selia gha Sapanga ampeghili Musa kwa umaha. Selia limlongosa ng'ogha mundu yula kahova kala ila ni kwa mundu yula kamkomu. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Mhumbu aposilwi, kwa mlandano, mhumbu anguwopwa na selia kwa mngwana ghaki kwa lipindi lyogha lya ukomu ghaki, ila hayu mngwana pakahova, hayu mhumbu anguwela pekesu kuhuma kuselia hila limkolili. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Hinu mhumbu hayu pakaposwa na mngwana ghangi lipindi mngwana ghaki kamkomu, hayu angukemwa mngongola, ila mngwana ghaki pakahova, mhumbu hayu kapekesu kuhuma selia, na paikawela kaposwa na mngwana ghangi, hayu mhumbu kamngongola ng'ogha. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />havi ndiwa iwela kwa mwenga hila hila hata mwenga muwopwa ng'ogha na selia kwaikiva muhova pamonga na Kilisito kulipingika, hinaa mwenga ni wandu ghaki Sapanga hayu mweni kuhindulwa ili muwesi kughola lihengu maha lya Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Kwaikiva patulamili ngalilu gha kihigha, lumatamata lwa kughola sambi isoselilwi na selia mghati mwa twenga na kutuyeghela kihu. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Ila hinaa, tuwela pekesu kuhuma kuvihungu vya selia, kwaikiva tunguwela tuhova kukovekelana na mighalu hila ituwopili. Hinu tunguwesa kumtumikila Sapanga kwa kukovekela njila hyonu pahi gha unkosi wa Mpumulo ghaki, tukileka kukovekela njila zya dahile pahi gha unkosi wa selia iyandikilwi.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Selia na sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Hinu tulongi kyani? Yiwa selia gha Sapanga ampeghili Musa ni sambi? Ng'ogha! Ila pangaliwela ng'ogha sambi selia ingamanyika ng'ogha. Ningalimanya ng'ogha yiwa lumatamata ni liki ikiva selia ingaleka kulonga, “Lumatamata lunguhakata.” <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Ila kwa kuwela kwa selia, sambi ikapeghwa njila hata kuyinula njila wekaweka zya lumatamata mghati mwa nenga kwa njila gha selia, kwaikiva paiwela ng'ogha selia sambi inguwela ni kindu kihova. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Haku dahile nilamili handa nipalile mweni ila selia paihikile nikamanya yiwa ni mweni sambi na nenga nikahova. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Nikalola yiwa selia zyenikupalwa kunyeghela ukomu, kwa nenga zikaniyeghela kihu. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Kwaikiva sambi kwa kupata fwasi kuselia, iningongili na kwa kupitila hai selia, ikanikoma. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Selia hazi zinguhuma kwa Sapanga ni zyamaha na zinguwoneka handa zingupalwa kuwela. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Chakaka kindu haki kya maha kitewesa ng'ogha, kuniyambusila kihu! Ila sambi ndiwa iniyambusilile kihu kwa njila gha selia maha. Liwelili lukani lwa Sapanga yiwa selia ziweli zingulangiha yiwa sambi ni kindu kihakata.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makakala gha sambi kungalilu gha twenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Chakaka ng'ogha nenga mweni kughola mahakata, ila sambi yenikulikala mghati gha nenga. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Chakaka nimanya ng'ogha kindu nikighola, kwaikiva kila mbala kukighola, nikighola ng'ogha, ila kila nikihyomela, ndiwa ningukighola. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Hinu handa ningughola kila nipala ng'ogha kughola, ningujumila yiwa selia ni maha. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Ila kwa uchakaka, ng'ogha nenga mweni kughola lila nilipala ng'ogha ila ni hila sambi itamili mghati mwa nenga. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Ningumanya yiwa mghati mwa nenga likala ng'ogha mghalu maha, pamonga na yiwa kupala kughola mghalu maha ningupala, ila lila lya maha kulighola niwesa ng'ogha. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Ingumaanisa, badili gha kughola hula mghalu maha niupala kuughola, ningughola hula mghalu niupala ng'ogha kuughola. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Hinu handa ningughola lila nipalile ng'ogha kughola, ingumaanisa yiwa ng'ogha nenga kangi mweni kughola hagha, ila ni hila sambi yeni kulikala mghati mwa nenga. <verse eid="ROM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Panipalile kughola lya maha ninguilolela ningughola lila lya maha ng'ogha. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Kwaikiva kuumundu ghangu wa mghati ninguihekelelela selia gha Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Ila ningulola yiwa kuvile na selia ghangi ingughola lihengu muhigha gha nenga, selia hila yeni kungingamana na hila selia yeni kujumila malangu ghangu. Hai ingunighola niweli mhusutu wa selia gha sambi yeni kughola lihengu mhigha ghangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Chondi nenga ni ghani atenilokola kuhuma kumhigha hau weni kuniyeghela kihu? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Ningumshukwile Sapanga kwaikiva mweni ndiwa atenilokola kupitila Yesu Kilisito Bambu wa twenga. Hinu nenga baha ningutumikila selia gha Sapanga ghangu, ila kwa ngalilu ghangi ningutumikila selia gha sambi.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Ukomu kumpumulo wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Hinu kwahela ulamulo kwa wala weni kukongana na Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Kwaikiva, selia gha Mpumulo yeni kunikonganisa kuukomu na Kilisito Yesu inikombola kuhuma kuselia gha sambi na kihu. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Sapanga atimilisili mighalu hila selia isindilwi kutimilisa, kwaikiva gha ulepelelu wa umundu. Sapanga akamyegha Mwana ghaki ili ayalamisi sambi, na kwa mhigha hula akayalamisa sambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Sapanga agholile nagha lukani tuwesi kulama handa selia ingupala, na ng'ogha kulongoswa kangi na makakala gha mihigha gha twenga yeni sambi, ila kwa makakala gha Mpumulo. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Kwaikiva wala wangulikala kwa kukovekelana na vila mhigha ungupala wangulongoswa na mhigha, ila wala wangulikala kwa kukovekela Mpumulo, wanguvika lukani lwau kumighalu yeni kupalwa na Mpumulo. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Kwaikiva wandu weni kulongoswa na mhigha wanguyeghelwa kihu, ila kuwela na lukani lweni kulongoswa na Mpumulo ni ukomu na kunguyegha kuwela kutali na ngondu. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Kwaikiva mundu mweni kulongoswa na mawachilo gha higha ni mhakata wa Sapanga, na kwa uchakaka kanguwesa kutundamila selia gha Sapanga, wala awesi ng'ogha kuyitikila selia gha Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Wala wandu weni kuyitikila mapalo gha higha, wawesa ng'ogha kughola ghala yeni kumhekelesa Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Ila mwenga, myitikila ng'ogha yala yeni kupalwa na higha, ila yala gha Mpumulo, ikiva Mpumulo wa Sapanga angulama mghati gha mwenga. Handa Sapanga angulikala mghati mwa mwenga hinu mwenga mkovekela ng'ogha mapalo gha higha. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Hinaa Kilisito angulikala mghati gha mwenga. Pamonga na yiwa mihigha gha mwenga inguhova kwaikiva gha sambi, hinu Mpumulo wa Sapanga anguwapegha ukomu kwaikiva Sapanga kawaghola mjumiliki kuulongolo ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Ikiva Mpumulo wa Sapanga yula amuhindulili Yesu kuhuma kukihu angulikala mghati mwa mwenga, hinu hayu amuhindulili Kilisito kuhuma kukihu ateipegha ukomu mihigha gha mwenga yeni kuhova, kwa njila gha Mpumulo ghaki mweni kulikala mghati gha mwenga. <verse eid="ROM 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Hinu hinaa, walongo wa nenga twenga tungupalwa ng'ogha kulikala kwa kukovekela mihigha vila ingupala tulikali. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Kwaikiva mkilikala kwa kukovekela vila mihigha ingupala, mtehova, ila handa pamtelikala kwa kulongoswa na Mpumulo mtetangwa na hayu Mpumulo kukoma matendu gha higha na hinu mtelama. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Kwaikiva wogha weni kulongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga ni wana wa Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Kwaikiva, Mpumulo mpeghilwi mwenga na Sapanga anguwaghola ng'ogha mwenga kuwela wahusutu na kuwaghola mutili ila hayu Mpumulo anguwaghola mwenga muweli wana wa Sapanga na kwa makakala gha Mpumulo hayu, twenga tunguwesa kumkema Sapanga, “Aba,” ingumaanisa “Tati” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Hilahila na mweni Mpumulo wa Sapanga anguhighilisa mghati mwa mpumulo gha twenga yiwa twenga ni wana wa Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Hinu, kwaikiva twenga ni wana wa Sapanga, tutepokela highili zyogha Sapanga awavikilili wana ghaki, pamonga na Kilisito, na tukihakilwa pamonga na mweni hilahila tuteyinulwa pamonga na mweni.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sapanga katuvikila wandu ghaki mighalu mikulunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Ninguvalanga yiwa mahakili gha twenga gha hinaa yanguwesa ng'ogha kulandine na hila mighalu mikulu ivile Sapanga katuvikila twenga wandu ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Vindu vyogha vilumbilwi vingulindila kwa luhujulu nesu pala Sapanga atewalangila lipala wana ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Kila kyeni kulumbwa na Sapanga akilekili kiweli na ulepelelu hau, iwelili ng'ogha mapalo ghao vindu vyogha vilumbilwi vipalili ng'ogha vyeni viweli nagha, ila Sapanga alekesili hagha yahumili kwa lukani lwa litumaini hali. <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />lya kukombolwa ili vikotoho kuyalamiswa. Na kangi vindu vyogha vyeni kulumbwa vingulindila lichuwa lya kulikongana na wana wa Sapanga kuupekesu mkulu na kuleka kihu kikatuyalamisa. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Kwaikiva tungumanya yiwa hata hinaa vilumbi vyogha vingulila handa kwa utungu wa mdala mweni kukolwa na utungu lipindi lya kuiwopola. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Ng'ogha hagha vilumbi wekayao, ila hata twenga weni hayu Mpumulo wa Sapanga, mweni kuwela wa mtumbulo kuhupo zya Sapanga, na twenga hilahila tungung'ung'ulika mghati, kunu tukilindila tugholwi wana wa Sapanga, ingumaanisa kukombola na kughalambula mihigha gha twenga kuwela mihyonu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Kwaikiva tungulokolwa kulitumaini hali. Ikiva mundu kalola kala kila akitumainila, hali liwesa ng'ogha kuwela litumaini kangi, kwaikiva ni ghani mweni kuwesa kuyendelela kutumainila kindu kila angukilola kumihu? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Ila patutumainila kupokela kindu kila tukilola ng'ogha, hinu tutekilindila kwa ufumilifu. <verse eid="ROM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Na hilahila Mpumulo wa Sapanga angututanga kuulepelelo wa twenga, kwaikiva tumanya ng'ogha kuyupa vila ingupalwa. Ila Mpumulo wa Sapanga mweni angutuyupila kwa Sapanga kwa kung'ung'ulika kula tuwesa ng'ogha kukulongelela. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Namweni Sapanga mweni kuwesa kulola yala yavile mghati mwa mioyu gha twenga, angumanya mawachilo gha Mpumulo ghaki, kwaikiva Mpumulo anguwayupila wandu wa Sapanga kukovekelana na mapalo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Twenga tungumanya yiwa, kumighalu hyogha, Sapanga angughola lihengu pamonga na wala wogha weni kumpala, kukuwapatila ghala gha maha, ingumaanisa, wala wakemilwi kwa lukani lwaki. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Kwaikiva wala awahaghulili kuhuma mtumbulo wa kulumbwa kwa mlima wogha, ndiwa awamanyili ili wapati kulandine na Mwana ghaki, ili Mwana aweli mhacha mkulu paghati gha wana wogha wa Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Hinu, wala wavile Sapanga katumbula kuwahaghula, akawakema, wala awakemili hilahila akawajumila kuwela wamaha, na wala awajumilile kuwela wamaha kuulongolo ghaki, hilahila akawayinula.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upalo wa Sapanga ku Kilisito Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Hinu, tulonge niki kwa mighalu hai? Ikiva Sapanga kapamonga na twenga ni ghani kanguwesa kutungingama? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Kwaikiva Sapanga kamuwonela ng'onga luhungu mwana ghaki wa weka, ila amyeghili ili ahovi kwaikiva gha twenga wogha, hinu chakaka hilahila atetupatila vindu vighangi vya maheli. <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Ni ghani atewasitaki wahaghulwa wa Sapanga? Ni Sapanga mweni baha ndiwa kalongela yiwa wawela ng'ogha na mahakata. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Ni ghani atewalamula? Kwa hela. Kwaikiva Kilisito Yesu ahindukili kwaikiva gha twenga, kangi angulama kuutundamilu kwa Sapanga akilongosa. Na mweni angutuyupila. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Ni ghani mweni kuwesa kutulekanisa na upalo wa Kilisito? Ghuli ni lung'ai au maghaso au mahakili au njala au kuwela ng'ogha na nguu au uhakata au kihu? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Handa Mayandiko gha Sapanga yalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">“Kwaikiva gha wenga tungulola wandu wanguyesa kutukoma kila lelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">tuvalangilwa handa kondolu wa kuhinjwa.” <verse eid="ROM 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Ila, kumighalu hai hyogha, tupokela usindi mkulunga kwa mtanga ghaki Kilisito yula mweni kutupala. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Kwaikiva ningumanya chakaka yiwa kwahela kindu kinguwesa kutulekanisa na upalo ghaki, ng'ogha kihu, au ukomu, au watumikila wa Sapanga wa kundumba au mahoka, au makakala ghangi gha Lihyukana, hata yeni kuhumila hinaa, hata yatehumila kuulongolo, hilahila weni uweso, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />au mighalu yeni kuwela kumlimawogha wa kunani, au mighalu yenikuwela kumlimawogha gha pahi, na kwahela kiumbi chochose kitewesa kutulekanisa na upalo wa Sapanga uvile ku Kilisito Yesu Bambu wa twenga.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Sapanga na wandu ghaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ningulonga uchakaka, nikongana na Kilisito na nenga niwesa ng'ogha kulonga uhwangi. Mghati mwa nenga kukilongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga kunguhighilisa yiwa ningulonga ng'ogha uhwangi. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Chakaka nenga nivili na mahakilo yayomoka ng'ogha kumoyu ghangu. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Kwaikiva gha wandu wa mlima ghangu ingaliwela ni mapalo ghangu nenga mweni ningalijumila kukolwa na mahakata handa kughola nagha, kungaliwaghola walongo ghangu hagha wamkwinili Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Hagha ndiwa wandu wa Izilaili. Wavile Sapanga awahaghulile kuwela wana ghaki, akawakonganisa ukulu ghaki, akaghola na weno malaghano, akawapegha selia ghaki, ukwinila wa chakaka na kila akilongelile. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Weni ni wawelekwa wa watati wa twenga wakulu, na mweni Kilisito awelekili handa twenga wandu kuukolu hau. Ila mweni ni Sapanga na mweni kukwilikiwa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. Hina. <verse eid="ROM 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Nilongile ng'ogha yiwa akilongilile Sapanga yiwa kisindwa. Kwaikiva ng'ogha kila mundu kuhuma ku Izilaili ni mundu wa Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Hilahila ng'ogha wawelekwa wogha wa Ibulahimu ni wana wa Sapanga. Ila, handa iyandikilwi ku Mayandiko gha Sapanga, “Wawelekwa ghaki watehumila kwa Isaka.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Hai ingumanisa yiwa, ng'ogha wana walelilwi kihigha wawela wana wa Sapanga, ila ni wana wala wahika kupitila kila akilongilile Sapanga ndiwa watekemwa wana ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Kwaikiva malongelo yeni ni hagha, “Nitekuhuyila kangi lipindi handa hali, na Sala atelela mwana mlumi.” <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Ng'ogha hagha hela, ila hilahila Lebeka alelili na mbuyi wa twenga Isaka wana waivili mavila. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Ila, ili Sapanga awoneki yiwa anguhaghula vila angupala, hata paikawela pambila wala mavila wawelekwa ng'ogha au pambila wawesa kughalambula lya maha na lihakata. <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Lebeka alongelilwi nagha, “Mwana mkulu atemtumikila mnung'una.” Nagha mghalu hau uwonesa yiwa Sapanga angumkema mundu handa aipalili mweni angumkema mundu na ng'ogha kukovekela na matendu gha mundu. <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Handa vila Mayandiko gha Sapanga yailongile, “Nimpalilie nesu Yakobu kupiti Esau.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Hinu tulongi kyani? Pangi Sapanga kangubhaghula wandu? Ng'ogha hata mayaghani! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Sapanga amlongelili Musa, “Nitemgholela ulungwana mundu nipala kumgholela ulungwana na nitemwonela luhungu mundu nimpalile kumwonela luhungu.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Kwa nagha mighalu hyogha inguhika kwa luhungu lwa Sapanga ila inguhika ng'ogha kwa mapalo gha mundu. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Kwaikiva Mayandiko gha Sapanga yailongile nagha kwa Falao nkosi wa Misili, “Nikugholili uweli nkosi ili nipati kulangiha uweso ghangu umanyiki, na lihina lyangu litangaswi kokosi kumlima wogha.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Hinu hinaa ni lipala, yiwa Sapanga angumuwonela luhungu mundu yula angupala kumuwonela luhungu na paakapala kumghola aweli mweni kinyengu Sapanga angughola nagha.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilaka na luhungu lwa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Pangi utenikonya, “Ikiva mighalu ivile nagha, Sapanga anguwesaghuli kumlalamikila mundu? Ghani mweni kuwesa kuyangingama mapalo ghaki?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Ila, wenga mundu, kwa ghani hata uyesi kumkonya Sapanga? Ghuli, kimbundi kinguwesa kumkonya mghola vimbundi, “Kwa kyani wenga unighola handa nagha?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Mghola vimbundi anguwesa kughola vila angupala mweni kulutupi. Akauhumisa kulilundila lya lutupi anguwesa kughola vimbundi viivili kwa lipindi limonga na kimbundi kimonga kya kuvikila lua na kighangi kya kuvikila ndaka. <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Nagha wamonga gha wandu ni handa vimbundi viyandalwa kuyalamiswa. Hinu Sapanga kawawonesa lilaka lyaki. Sapanga kahighilisa uwesa ghaki. Hinu, awelili na ufumilifu nesu, akiwafumilila wala wavile kawavika kulukani lwa kuwahakili, wavile wapalilwi kuyalamiswa. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Hilahila apalili kulangiha lipala utangala wa ukulu ghaki kwa twenga tuvile ndiwa lukani lwaki kutuwonela luhungu, twenga tuwela katuyandala kala kupokela ukulu ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Kwaikiva twenga ndiwa wala awakemili, ng'ogha kuhuma kwa Wayahudi weka ila hilahila kuhuma kwa wandu wavili ng'ogha Wayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Handa Sapanga vila ailongile ku kihitabu kya Hosea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">“Nitewakema ‘Wandu ghangu’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">Wala wavile ng'ogha wandu ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">na nenga nitemkema ‘mpalo ghangu’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">yula avile ng'ogha mpalo ghangu nitelonga mundu nimpalile,” <verse eid="ROM 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />kangi, Itewela nesu nesu mahala pala pawalongelilwi, “Mwenga ng'ogha wandu ghangu.” Weni watekemwa “Wana wa Sapanga avile mkomu.” <verse eid="ROM 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Hilahila mlota wa Sapanga Isaya alongili kwa lilowi likulunga kwa Waizilaili, “Pamonga na yiwa wana wa Izilaili ni watangala handa mhanga wa muufuku, ni mayaghani hela ndiwa watelokolwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Kwaikiva, Bambu Sapanga atetimilisa ulamula ghaki kwa kuloposela.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Pambila gha hagha mlota wa Sapanga Isaya ailongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">“Handa Bambu mweni Makakala hyogha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">angalitulekela ng'ogha amonga wa wana wa Izilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">tungaliwela kala tunyanywa lyoto handa Sodoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">tungaliwela kala tunyanywa lyoto handa Gomola.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo anguwayupila wandu wa Izilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Kwa nagha tulonge kyani hinu? Yiwa wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi wavile wahakula ng'ogha wajumilwi na Sapanga, ila wakajumilwa kuwela wamaha kwanjila gha ukwinila, <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Ila Izilaili, weni wayangalili kuhaka kujumilwa kwa njila gha selia, ila wapata ng'ogha kujumilwa kwa selia. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Kwa kyani? Kwaikiva wahakulili ng'ogha kwa kumkwinila Kilisito ila kwa kupitila matendu ghao. Wakalikwala kulila “Liganga likulu lyeni kuwaghola wandu waguwi.” <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Handa yailonga Mayandiko gha Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">“Uloli ninguvika ku Sayuni liganga litewaghola wandu walikwali kwaikiva gha kuguwisa wandu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">ila yula mweni kukwinila atekolwa ng'ogha na honi machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Walongo ghangu, kindu ningupala na mayupo ghangu kwa Sapanga ni walongu ghangu Waizilaili wapati kulokolwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Kwa ikiva ninguwesa kuhighilisa badili gha weni yiwa wanguyangala nesu kumuhaka Sapanga, ila kuyangala haku wangutumila ng'ogha malangu gha chakaka. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Kwaikiva wamanyile ng'ogha vila Sapanga anguwajumila wandu yiwa wamaha na wakajihakulila njila ghao weni gha kuwela na haki. Wakalema kukovekela njila gha kujumilwa na Sapanga kuulongolo ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Kwaikiva Kilisito atimilisili mighalu hila selia iwelili ingukipala ili kila mweni kukwinila ajumilwi na Sapanga yiwa kamaha.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulokola ni kwa wogha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Musa ayandikili yala yenikumghola mundu ujumilwi na Sapanga kuulongolo ghaki kwa kupitila selia, “Mundu yoyosi mweni kutimilisa hagha yailongilile selia atelama.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Ila havi ndiwa ingulongwa kwa habali gha kujumilika kuulongolo gha Sapanga kwa kupitila ukwinila, “Ukotoho kuilongela mmoyu, ni ghani atekwela kundumba?” Ingumaanisa kumuhulusa Kilisito pahi. <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Hilahila ukotoho kuikonya, “Ghani ateyenda kumambi akamlongela Kilisito ahinduki?” Ingumaanisa kumkwelesa Kilisito kuhuma kukihu. <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Ila Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulonga nagha, “Ujumbi hau wa Sapanga uvile pabehi na wenga, uvile mumlomo ghako na mmoyu ghako” na hau ndiwa kula kukwinila tungukutangasa. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Ikiva utelonga kiuhighgiliso kwa mlomo ghako wenga mweni yiwa Yesu ni Bambu na kukwinila mmoyu ghako yiwa Sapanga ndiwa amhindulili kuhuma kukihu, utelokoka. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Kwaikiva mundu angukwinila kwa moyu akajumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga, na angulongela kiuhighiliso kwa waghangi mweni handa mweni kwa mlomo ghaki atelokolwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Handa Mayandiko gha Sapanga yailongile, “Yoyose mweni kumkwinila Kilisito atekolwa ng'ogha na honi.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Mghalu hau ni wa wogha kwaikiva kwahela mlekano paghati mwa Wayahudi na Wayahudi ng'ogha, mweni ni Bambu wa wogha, mweni ni mlungwana kwa wogha weni kumyupa mtanga. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Kwa ikiva Mayandiko yangulonga, “Kila mundu ateyupa kwa lihina lya Bambu, atelokolwa.” <verse eid="ROM 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Hinu, watemyupaghuli yula avile wamkwinila ng'ogha? Kangi, watemkwinilaghuli ikiva wayoghanilili ng'ogha habali zyaki? Na wateyoghanilaghuli habali zyaki ikiva kwahela mtangasa? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Na wandu watetangasaghuli handa wayeghwa ng'ogha? Handa ingulongwa ku Mayandiko gha Sapanga, “Ulolayi vila ivile maha kuhika kwa wala weni kuyegha Habali Maha.” <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ila ng'ogha wogha wayitikilili hila Habali Maha. Kwaikiva Isaya mlota wa Sapanga mweni ailongile, “Bambu, ni ghani avile kakwinila ujumbi wa twenga?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Hinu, mtumbulo wa kukola ukwinila ni kuhyoghanila Habali Maha hila imlongela Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Ila ningukonya, ghuli, wayoghanila ng'ogha hau ujumbi? Hina, chakaka wauyoghanila, handa mayandiko yangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">“Wandu wayoghanila ujumbi gha Sapanga mahala kogha mumlimawogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">milando ghao ihika mbaka mwihu gha mmbali gha mlima wogha.” <verse eid="ROM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />kangi ningukonya, Ghuli, inguwesekana yiwa wandu wa Izilaili wamanyili ng'ogha? Musa mweni baha ni wa mtumbulo kuyanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">“Nitewaghola mwenga weni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">kuwela wandu ghangu muwawoneli wifu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">wala wandu wavile ng'ogha Wawaizilaeli pala paniwahighila kwaikiva wanikwinila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">nitewaghola muweli na lilaka kwa hagha weni kuwela wandu ghangu ng'ogha.” <verse eid="ROM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Kangi Isaya mwenikuwela mlota wa Sapanga alongile kwa uhighiliso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">“Wala wavile wanihakula ng'ogha wanilola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">nijilangiha kwa wala weni kukonya ng'ogha habali zyangu.” <verse eid="ROM 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Ila kwa Waizilaili angulonga nagha, “Pamuhi hyogha niwakemili wandu ghangu wanihuyili wandu watatala na weni kuyitikila ng'ogha.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="q">Luhungu lya Sapanga kwa Waizilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Hinu, ningukonya, ghuli, Sapanga kawalema wandu ghaki? Ng'ogha hata mayaghani. Nenga mweni baha ni Muizilaili, kiwelekwa kya Ibulahimu, wa likabila lya Benjamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Sapanga kawaleka ng'ogha wandu ghaki awahaghulili kuhuma mtumbulo. Mkumbwiki vila yailonga Mayandiko gha Sapanga pala Eliya pakaisitaki Izilaili kuulongolo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Mweni ailongili, “Bambu, wandu wawakoma walota ghako na kubomola luhanja ghako lwa maganga, nihighala nenga weka ghangu, na weni wangupala kunikoma.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Ila Sapanga amyangili niki? amyangili nagha, “Nenga nambila kuwela na watovangondo ielufu isaba weni kukanila kumyupa mulungu Baali.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Hinu ndiwa inguwoneka hilahila hata lipindi hali lya hinaa, kuvile na mahighalo gha Waizilaili mayaghani hela wavile Sapanga kawahaghula kwa umaheli wa ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Uhaghula ghaki unguhika kupitila ulungwana ghaki, na ng'ogha kwaikiva gha matendu ghao. Handa ingawela kwa matendu maheli yangaliwela ng'ogha kindu. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Hinu tulongi kyani? Kila kindu kyeni kuwela kinguhakulwa na Izilaili kwa kuyangala wakipata ng'ogha. Ila wala mayaghani kwa Waizilaili wahaghulwa wakipata. Na wala wahighalile wakataywa utopa, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />handa vila iyandikwa ku Mayandiko, “Sapanga kaghola mioyu ghao kuwela mitopa, na mbaka lelu hagha wawesa ng'ogha kulola kwa mihu ghao hata kuyughanila kwa mapulikilo ghao.” <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Hilahila Daudi angulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">“Mihambu ghao gha mulyo Sapanga aghalambuli iweli wambu na miteghu ili kuwawomela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">waguwi na kunyokolwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Mihu ghao ivikwi lwisa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">wakotoho kulola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">Migoghu ghao igondami.” <verse eid="ROM 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Hinu ningukonya, ghuli, Waizilaili walikwala hata waguwi wakakotoho kugholoka kangi? Ng'ogha hata mayaghani. Ila kuguwa kwa weni ni kwaikiva gha mahakata ghao, ulokola ukawahikila wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi, ili kuwaghola Waizilaili wawoni wifu. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Hinu ikiva kuguwa kwa weni kukayegha unaisa kumlimawogha, na kupungula kwa weni kukayegha unaisa kwa wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi. Ghuli, kwa Waizilaili kuhuya na kumkwinila mlokola kwau watehighilwa ng'ogha nesu?<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulokoka kwa wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Hinaa ningulonga na mwenga wandu mvile ng'ogha Wayahudi. Na nenga ningulihekelelela lihengu lyangu, kwa kumanya yiwa niyeghwa handa mndumindumi kuwayeghela Habali Maha wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Ili kuwaghola Wayahudi wayangu waloli wifu na nikawesa kuwalokola amonga gha weni. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Kwaikiva Wayahudi pawakanili Yesu, na mweni Sapanga akawakanila weni, akakonganika na wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi. Kwa nagha, lipindi lila Spanga atekonganika na Wayahudi kangi, itewela handa wandu wahinduka. <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Ikiva kipandi kya mtumbulo kya libumunda kiyeghwa kwa Bambu hilahila na libumunda lyogha litewela lya Bambu, hinu hilahila ikiva mikegha gha libiki ni hindu gha Bambu hinu na miputila ghaki hyogha ni gha Bambu. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Hinaa amonga gha miputila mighangi idumulilwi, na mwenga wandu mvile ng'ogha Wayahudi ndiwa handa miputila gha libiki lilela zaituni lya kumwitu mkonganiswa kukonganika pamonga na miputila yenikuhighala gha libiki lilela zaituni likulilwa. Mngupokela mulyo kupitila ku mikegha gha libiki lilela zaituni likulilwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Hinu ukotoho kulikwina kwina kunani gha hagha maputila. Handa ukalikwina, ukumbuki mghalu hau. Ng'ogha wenga mweni kukola lisina, ila ni lisina ndiwa lyeni kukukola wenga. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Pangi utewesa kunilongela, “Miputila hila idumulilwi lukani nenga mbati kuvikwa kufwasi ghao.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Hai ni chakaka. Wadumulilwi kwaikiva walemili kukwinila na wenga ungugholoka kwaikiva ungumkwinila Kilisito. Hinaa ukotoho kulidumbila, ila utili. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Kwa ikiva handa Sapanga kawonela ng'ogha luhungu Wayahudi wavile ni handa miputila gha chakaka, ghuli, unguliwachila atekuwonela luhungu wenga? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Hinu uliwachili kwa habali gha ulungwana wa Sapanga na ukalipa ghaki hilahila. Mweni ni mkalipa kwa wala weni kuleka kumkovekela, ila mweni ni mlungwana kwa wenga, ikiva weka uteyendelela kuulungwana ghaki. Na paitewela utelema, wenga hilahila utedumulwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Hilahila Wayahudi pawaleka uhakata ghao na kumuhuyila Sapanga, watehuyiswa kangi handa libiki kumatikwa kangi kulisina lyau, kwaikiva Sapanga kana uweso wa kuwamatika kangi kulisina lyau. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Mwenga wandu mvile ng'ogha Wayahudi, kuhuma dahile ni handa liputila lya Mseituni wa kumhitu, uvile udumulwa na kuulongolo ukamatikwa kulisina lya mseituni ukululilwi. Ila Wayahudi kwa chakaka ni handa mseituni kulitawa, na itewela ng'ogha mhigu kwa weni kumatikwa kangi kulibiki lilalila lyau.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhungu lya Sapanga kwa wogha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Walongu wa nenga, nipala ng'ogha mkotoho kumanya mfisu hau, lukani mkotoho kujilola yiwa ni wandu wavile na malangu nesu. Mfisu weni ndiwa hau. Amonga gha Waizilaili wateyendelela kuleka kukwinila mbaka pala wandu wa milima ghangi kwa utangala wau wamhyukili Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Hinu ndiwa Waizilaili wogha watelokolwa, handa yailonga Mayandiko gha Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">“Mlokola atehika kuhuma Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">atehumisa uhakata wogha wa kiwelekwa kya Yakobu. <verse eid="ROM 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Na nenga Sapanga hagha ndiwa malaghanu niteghola kwa weni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">panihumisa sambi zyao.” <verse eid="ROM 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Kwaikiva wanguilema Habali Maha, hinu Wayahudi wawela wahakata wa Sapanga, ili mwenga wandu wa milima ghangi mpati fwasi gha kujumilwa na Sapanga. Ila weni wangujumilwa kwaikiva gha malaghano ghaki na Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobu. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Sapanga pakawahaghula wandu wajumiliki kuulongolo ghaki kanguwesa ng'ogha kughalambuka kwa wala awahaghulile. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Handa mwenga haku mtumbulo muwelili wahakata kwa Sapanga ila hinaa mpokela ulungwana kwaikiva gha kulema kukwinila kwa weni. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Wangumyitikila ng'ogha Sapanga hinaa, ila Sapanga kawela mmaha kwa mwenga ili Sapanga aweli mmaha kwa weni hilahila. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Sapanga kangulonga wandu wogha wangosela, hai ni kwaikiva wamuyitikila ng'ogha, angulonga nagha ili atulangihi umaha ghaki na kumlekekesela kila mundu.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sapanga atundamiliwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Hina Sapanga kamkulu, kana kila kindu, angumanya kila kindu, kwahela mundu kanguwesa kumanya kindu kila angukiwachila kughola. Kwahela mundu kanguwesa kulongela njila zyaki vila angughola mahengu.<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Handa iyandikwa ku Mayandiko gha Sapanga, “Ghani mweni kuwesa kumanya lukani lwa Bambu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">Ni ghani mweni kuwesa kuwela msauli ghaki?” <verse eid="ROM 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />“Au ni ghani mweni kumpegha Sapanga chochose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">ili amhipi?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Kwa ikiva vindu vyogha vinguhuma kwa mweni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:36">vyeni vinguwela kwaikiva gha uwesa ghaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:36">Ukulu ni wa mweni machuwa hyogha bila mwihu! Hina.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Ngalilu gha kumtumikila Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Kwa nagha, walongo ghangu, kwaikiva Sapanga katuwonela luhungu ninguwaluwa nesu kwa moyu wogha. Mlihumisi mwenga maweni muweli handa litambiku liwela likomu, na kughola nagha ndiwa njila gha chakaka gha kumuyupa Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Mkotoho kughola handa waigholile wandu wa mlima wogha hau, ila mumlekeseli Sapanga awawesesi kughalambula vila mnguliwachila, ndiwa mtewesa kumanya na kughola mighalu aipalile Sapanga kuhuma kwa mwenga. <verse eid="ROM 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Kwaikiva gha umaha nipeghilwi na Sapanga ninguwalongela kila mmonga paghati gha mwenga, mkotoho kujiwachilila mwenga maweni yiwa ni wamaha kupiti vila ingupalwa na kuilola yiwa mwenga mwawakulu kupiti vila iwela. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Handa vila mngumanya mhigha ni mmonga ila uvile na vikongonu vitangala, na kila kikongonu kivile na lihengu lyaki. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Hilahila pamonga na yiwa twenga twangenju,ila kwa kukongana na Kilisito tuwela mhigha mmonga, na kila mmonga wa twenga ni kikongonu kya myaki. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Tuvile na hupo gha weka weka kila mmonga kwa vila tupeghwa kwa ulungwana wa Sapanga. Yula apeghilwi uwesa wa kuwalongela wandu ujumbi wa Sapanga na alonge hagha kwa ukwinila. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Mweni kupeghwa uwesa wa utumikila na atumikili kwa umaha. Mweni kupeghwa uwesa wa kuvula na avuli kwa umaha. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Yula mweni kupeghwa uwesa wa kutaya moyu waghangi, awakanisi. Na yula mweni kupeghwa uwesa wa kupegha, apeghi kwa moyu wogha. Na mweni kugholokela waghangi, awagholokeli kwa kuyangala. Na yula apeghilwi uwesa wa kuwonela luhungu waghangi, agholi nagha kwa luheku. <verse eid="ROM 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Muwapali wayenu kwa moyu mbuleti. Kangi mkotoho kughola sambi ila muweli mkighola ghamaha lipindi lyogha. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Mpalani mwenga kwa mwenga kwa uchakaka handa vila walongo, hilahila mtundamilani mwenga kwa mwenga. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Mkotoho kuwela wapweli, ila myangalai pamumtumikila Bambu. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Mhekeleli kwaikiva mngumyaghamila Sapanga, muweli na ufumilifu pamuhakilwa na myupi kwa kukwinila lipindi lyogha. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Muwatangi wandu wa Sapanga kwa kuwapegha kila wapungukilwa nachu, muwapokeli wahenja kwa utundamilu. <verse eid="ROM 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Muwayupili maheli wala wogha wahakata wa mwenga, muwayupili na mkotoho kuwalapila. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Mhekeleli pamonga na weni kuhekelela, mlile pamonga na weni kulila. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Myoghanilani paghati mwa mwenga, mkotoho kuwela na lukani lwa kujitutumula, ila mjumili kulikala kuunyenyekela. Mkotoho kujiwachila yiwa ni weni malangu nesu. <verse eid="ROM 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Mundu akikugholela uhakata ukotoho kumuhuyisila mundu uhakata. Uyangali kughola gha maha kuulongolo gha wandu wogha. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Kwa njila yoyosi hila myangalai kuwela na kulikala kwa kuponga na wandu wogha. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Walongo wa nenga wapalwa, ukotoho kumhuyisila mundu yula akugholilile uhakata, ila mlekeli Sapanga kulilaka lyaki amuhuyisili, kwaikiva ku Mayandiko gha Sapanga ingulonga , “Kuwahuyisila ni lihengu lya nenga, nenga nitewahuyisila, angulonga Bambu.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Badili ghaki, Mayandiko yangulonga, “Mhakata ghako paakiva na njala, mpeghi mulyo, paakiva na uyumililo, mpeghi kya kunywegha. Kwa kughola nagha ungumghola akolwi na honi.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Ukotoho kusindwa na uhakata, ila wenga uusinde uhakata kwa ulungwana.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Kuwayitikila weni kukulongosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Kila mundu angupalwa kuwayitikila wakulu wa silikali. kwaikiva kwahela mwenikuwesa kulongosa bila uwesa wa Sapanga, na uwesa wa kulongosa unguhuma kwa Sapanga, na wala wenikulongosa hinaa wavikwa na Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Mweni kungingama ulongosi wa vilongosi hayu angungingama ulongosi wa Sapanga na hagha weni kughola nagha angujiyeghela ulamula mweni baha. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Kwaikiva, wandu weni kughola mahakata ndiwa weni kuwatila wala weni kuwalongosa ila wala weni gha maha wanguwatila ng'ogha vilongosi wala weni kuwalongosa, hinu ungupala kumtila ng'ogha mundu mweni kukulongosa? Ungholi ghamahala na weni watekupala na kuwayinula. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Kwaikiva weni ni watumikila wa Sapanga wangughola lihengu kwa kwaikiva gha kuwatanga mwenga baha. Ila pamghola mahakata muwatili kwaikiva weni wanguwesa kukuwanyokola mwenga. Weni watumikila wa Sapanga weni kulangiha lilaka lyaki kwa wala weni kughola mahakata. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Kwa nagha ni lasima kuwatundamila weni ulongosi, ng'ogha kwaikiva mnyokolu wa Sapanga, ila kwaikiva mngumanya yiwa mngupalwa kughola nagha. <verse eid="ROM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Hai ndiwa kwaikiva mwenga mnguhipa kodi, ni kwaikiva hagha vilongosi wangutumila lipindi lyau lyogha kumtumikila Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Mumpeghi kila mundu ghala mngupalwa kumhipa. Handa mngupalwa kuhipa kodi mhipi kodi, na ikiva usulu, mhipi usulu. Mumtundamili mweni kupalwa kutundamilwa.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulama kuupalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Mkotoho kuwela na lideni na mundu yeyosi, ila muweli na lideni lya kupalana weka, kwaikiva yula mweni kumpala myaki, katimilisa selia. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Kwaikiva amuli hazi zya Sapanga zyeni kulonga, “Ukotoho kughola ngongola,” “Ukotoho kukoma,” “Ukotoho kuhija,” “Ukotoho kuwela na lumatamata” na amuli ghangi zyogha kwa pamonga zivikwa pamonga kuamuli hai ngulu imonga, “Yiwa umpali myako handa ujipala mweni.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Mundu mweni kumpala myaki kangumgholela ng'ogha mahakata , hinu mundu mweni kuwapala wayaki angutimilisa selia. <verse eid="ROM 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Na mwenga mgholi havi, mkimanya lipindi tuwela hinaa. Lisaa lya kuyimuka kuhuma mulughonu litimila kala, kwaikiva hinaa ulokola wa twenga wapabehi nesu kupiti pala mtumbulo patukwinila. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Uhiku uyenda kala, na pamuhi kunguhika. Hinu tutaghi ghala matendu gha mlwisa na tuvali vindu vya kutovanila kumhana. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Machuwa hyogha tulikali kwa utundamilu vila ingupalwa kwaikiva tungulikala kumhana wa pamuhi, tukileka mihambu mihakata gha kulyegha nesu na ulowela, ndaka na ngongola, kutovana hilahila wifu. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Ila ngalilu gha mwenga ilongoswi na Yesu Kilisito, mkotoho kuliwachila vila mtetimilisa lumatamata lwa higha weni kuzyowelela sambi.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Ukotoho kulamulana mwenga kwa mwenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Mumkemi yula mweni kuwoneka mng'enya wa kukwinila, ila mkotoho kusindana kwa mawachilo ghaki. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Wamonga gha wandu wangukwinila wangulyegha kila kindu, ila weni kukwinila mayaghani wangulyegha vindu mayaghani. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Mundu mweni kulyegha kila kindu akotoho kumpughanya yula kawesa ng'ogha kulyegha kila kindu, na yula mweni kulyegha likolo lya mahamba weka yaki hilahila akotoho kumlamula yula mweni kulyegha kila kindu, kwaikiva Sapanga kamjumila. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Wenga kwa ghani hata uyesi kumlamula mtumikila wa mundu ghangi? Kwaikiva bambu ghaki ndiwa angumanya yiwa kaghola gha maha au ng'ogha. Na mtumikila ghaki ateghola handa ingupalwa kwaikiva Bambu ndiwa mwenikuwesa kumtanga agholi vila ingupalwa. <verse eid="ROM 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Mundu anguwesa kuliwachila yiwa lichuwa litenu lya maha kupiti lichuwa ghangi, Hilahila mundu ghangi anguwesa kuliwachila yiwa machuwa hyogha gha maha. Kila mmonga na akovekeli vila angukwinila. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Yula mweni kuvalanga lichuwa litenu yiwa lya maha kupiti lichuwa ghangi, angughola nagha kwa kumtundamila Bambu. Na mweni kulyegha vindu vyogha angughola nagha kwa kumtutundamila Bambu, kwaikiva angumshukwile Sapanga, na yula mweni kulyegha amonga hela gha vindu angughola nagha kwa Bambu na kumshukwile Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Kwaikiva kwahela mundu yoyosi paghati mwa twenga mweni kulama kwaikiva angupala kulama, hilahila kwahela yula mweni kuhova kwaikiva angupala ahovi. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Hinu ikiva tungulama, tungulama kwaikiva gha Bambu, na ikiva tunguhova, tunguhova kwaikiva gha Bambu. Kwa nagha ikiva tungulama, au ikiva tunguhova, twenga twa wandu wa Bambu. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Kwaikiva Kilisito ahovili na akahinduka ili apati kuwela Bambu wa weni ukomu na wahovili. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Hinu kwa kyani wenga ungumlamula mlongo ghako? Au kwa kyani wenga ungumpughanya mlongo ghako? Ikiva wogha tutegholoka kuulongolo gha kikalilo kya ulamulo kya Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Kwaikiva Mayandiko yangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">“Handa vila ningulama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">kila mundu atenitovela manung'una kuulongolo gha nenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">na kila mundu atetundamila yiwa nenga ni Sapanga.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Kwa nagha kila mundu paghati gha twenga atelitetela mweni handa mweni kuulongolo gha Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukotoho kumghola mlongo ghako alikwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Hinu tukotoho kulamulana badili ghaki mkoli lukani hali, mundu akotoho kughola kindu kinguwesa kumngingama au kumguwisa mlongu ghaki kusambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Mkonganiku ghangu na hayu Bambu Yesu, kungunihighilisila yiwa kwahela kindu chochosi kiwela mwiku kulyegha, ila mundu pakaliwachila yiwa mulyo mtenu unguwela mwiku kulyegha kuulongolo gha Sapanga, hinu kwa mweni kinguwela mwiku kulyegha. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Ikiva mlongo ghako angunyengemala kwa kila ungukilyegha, hinu wenga unguyendana ng'ogha na upalo. ukotoho kuleka kila ungukilyegha kimyalamisi mlongo ghako yula mweni kuwela Kilisito kahova kwaikiva gha mweni. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Hilala, Mkotoho kujumila kindu kila mkilola yiwa kwa mwenga ni maha kikamghola myako agholi sambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Kwaikiva unkosi wa Sapanga ng'ogha kwaikiva gha kulyegha na kunywegha, ila ni pamonga na haki, kulikala kwa kukotoho kutovana na luheku lweni kuyeghwa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga, <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />kwa ikiva mundu yoyose mweni kumtumikila Kilisito kwa njila hai, angumpala Sapanga na angujumilwa na wandu. <verse eid="ROM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Kwa nagha na tuyangalai nesu kughola mighalu hila yeni kuyegha kulikala kwa kukotoho kutovana kweni kututanga kuchengana twenga kwa twenga. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Hinu, mkotoho kuyalamisa lihengu lya Sapanga kwaikiva gha mulyo. Chakaka milyo hyogha ni maha, ila maha ng'ogha kulyegha kindu chochosi kyeni kumghola mlongo ghako alikwali msambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Mbaha kuleka kulyegha liwondu, kunywegha divai, au kughola chochose kila kyeni kumghola mlongo ghako alikwali msambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Hinu, Hinaa mwenga kila mngukikikwinila kunani gha mghalu hau iweli kifisu kya mwenga na Sapanga. Wahighilwa wandu wala wangujilamula ng'ogha kumoyu ghao yiwa ni maha ng'ogha. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ila wandu wala weni kulola holu kwa mulyo hula wanguulyegha, hagha watelamulwa na Sapanga kwaikiva wangughola kila wangukwinila ni kihakata kuulongolo gha Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Myangalai kuwahekelesa waghangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Twenga weni kukamala kuukwinila tungupalwa kuwatanga wala wavile wakamala ng'ogha kuukwinila, ila tukotoho kujihekelesa weni. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Kila mmonga wa twenga angupalwa kuwahekelesa wayaki kwa mighalu maha, ili kuwachenga kuukwinila. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />kwaikiva hata Kilisito kajipala ng'ogha mweni baha, handa iyandikilwi, “Malighu ghao wala wangukulighu wenga Sapanga yanihikila nenga.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Kwaikiva hyogha yaandikililwi haku dahile yaandikilwi kutuvula. Mayandiko hagha yangututanga kufumilila na kutughola tukamali ili tupati kuwela na litumaini. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Sapanga mweni ndiwa mwenikututanga kuwela wafumilifu na kukamala kuukwinila kwa nagha ningumyupa Sapanga awatangi muweli na lukani lumonga kwaikiva Kilisito angupala mlikali handa mweni angulikala, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />haku ndiwa mwenga wogha mtewesa kumuyinula Sapanga mweni kuwela Tati wa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habali Maha kwa wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Hinu mpokelani kwa upalo handa vila Kilisito katupokela twenga lukani Sapanga asifilwi na wandu wogha. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Kwaikiva ninguwalongela lipala yiwa Kilisito agholili utumikila kwa Wayahudi ili ahighilisi Sapanga kamchakaka na lukani atimilisi vila avilongile kwa wagogolo wa twenga, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />ili na wandu wavile Wayahudi ng'ogha wapati kumsifila Sapanga kwa ikiva gha luhungu ghaki. Handa yalongile Mayandiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">“Kwa nagha nitekusifila paghati gha wandu wavile Wayahudi ng'ogha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">Niteliyimbila lihina lyako sifa.” <verse eid="ROM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Kangi yangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">“Mwenga wandu weni kuwela ng'ogha Wayahudi, mhekelele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">pamonga na wandu wa ghaki Sapanga.” <verse eid="ROM 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Kangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">“Mumsifili Bambu, mwenga wandu wogha mvile ng'ogha Wayahudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">na kumyimbila kwa kumsifila, mwenga wandu wogha.” <verse eid="ROM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Mlota Isaya mweni ailongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">“Mundu mmonga kuhuma kukiwelekwa kya Yese atehika na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">mweni atelongosa wandu wa milima hyogha na weni watemtumainila yiwa ndiwa atewalokola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">na mweni atelongosa wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">na weni watemtumainila.” <verse eid="ROM 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Sapanga ndiwa angutupegha litumaini na awamemesi mwenga luheku lyogha na kukotoho kuwela na ngondo kukumkwinila, ili mpati kumema na litimaini likulunga kwa makakala gha Mpumulo wa Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utumikila wa Paulo kwa wandu Ng'ogha Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Walongo ghangu, nenga mweni baha ningukwinila yiwa mmema ulungwana na umanyi na kangi mnguwesa kuvulana mwenga kwa mwenga. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Ila niwayandikila kwa uhighiliso mulihamba hali handa kuwakumbusila kangi, kwaikiva gha umaha nipeghililwi na Sapanga, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />ili kuwela mtumikila wa Kilisito Yesu kwa wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi nikiwela na utumikila wa mtambika wa kutangasa Habali Maha gha Sapanga, ili wandu wavile ng'ogha waweli handa litambiku lyeni kumhekelesa Sapanga lyeni kughululwa na Mpumulo Mmbuleti pee. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Hinu, kwaikiva nikonganika na Kilisito Yesu, ninguitutumula panimtumikila Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Kwaikiva niwesa ng'ogha kuyesa kulonga kindu kingi, ila kila Kilisito akitimilisili kwa kupitila nenga lukani wandu wavile Wayahudi ng'ogha wapati kumtundamila Sapanga. Kwa kila nikilongile na kughola, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />kwa makakala gha vilangihi na makangaso, kwa uwesa wa Mpumulo wa Sapanga, paniwelile na mwanja nitangasili kutumbula Yelusalemu mbaka kumahala kogha mmbalimbali ghaki mbaka ku Ililiko, nitangasa kala kwa utali hai Habali Maha. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Ku hagha hyogha ninguyangala kutangasa Habali Maha mahala kuvile wandu ghangi wayesili ng'ogha kutangasilwa Habali gha Yesu Kilisito. Ningughola nagha ili nikotoho kuhuyila kutumbulisa lihengu lihyonu pala mundu ghangi kaghola kala, <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />handa vila Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">“Wala weni kuwela watangasilwi ng'ogha habali zyaki watelola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">na wala wayoghanili ng'ogha habali zyaki watemanya.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukasini lwa Paulo kutyangilila ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Hali ndiwa liningingamili miyanja itangala kuhika kwa mwenga. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Ila kwaikiva hinaa nimalila lihengu lyangu kumilima hai, na kwaikiva niwelili na luhujulu machuwa yatangala lwa kuhika kwa mwenga, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Ningutumainila kuwahikila panitewela ninguyenda kumlima wa Isipania. Ningupala kupitila haku na kuwalola mwenga, na hilahila kuhekelela pamonga na mwenga kwa lipindi lihupi, hinu niteyendelela na mwanja ningupala kupokela mtanga wa mwenga kumwanja hau. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Ila kwa hinaa, ninguyenda kuwatanga wandu wa Sapanga kula Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Kwaikiva mapinga gha wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito wa Makedonia na Akaya walamulile kuyegha mtanga kwa kuwatanga wamonga gha wandu wa Sapanga wala wavile kapuku haku ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Weni baha walamulile kughola nagha kwa mapalo ghao, ila kwa chakaka, hali ni lihengu lyau na weni. Kwaikiva, paikawela wandu wa milima ghangi walikonganisa kuhighili zya kumpumulo zya Wayahudi, wangupalwa na weni hilahila kuwagholela Wayahudi kumatumilo ghao gha kila lelo. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Kwa nagha paniyomola lihengu hali na kuhighilisa yiwa wapokela kila kindu kikungulilwi, nitepitila kwa mwenga nikiva munjila kuyenda ku Isipania. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Ningumanya yiwa panihika na kuwela na mwenga haku Kilisito atewahighila nesu. <verse eid="ROM 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Hinu, walongo ghangu, ninguwaluwa nesu kwa lihina lya Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito na kwa upalo wa Mpumulo wa Sapanga, mkonganiki na nenga kukumyupa Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Muyupi mbati kuhuka maha paghati gha wakwinila ng'ogha wa haku Uyahudi, na hau utumikila ghangu haku Yelusalemu upati kujumilwa na wandu wa Sapanga wenikuwela haku. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />ili kwa mapalo gha Sapanga niwesi kuhika kwa mwenga nikiva na luheku, ili nipeghani moyu pamonga na mwenga. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Hinu ningumluwa Sapanga mweni kuyegha wandu walikali kwa kuponga na aweli pamonga na mwenga wogha. Hina.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Paulo anguwajambusa wandu wekaweka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Ningupala kummanyisa kwa mwenga mhacha wa twenga Foibe, mtumikila ku lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lya Kenikilea. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Ninguluwa mumpokeli hayu namweni hilahila kamkwinila Kilisito handa twenga na kumpegha mtanga wowose ateupala kuhuma kwa mwenga, kwa ikiva mweni awelili mtanga kwa wandu watangala, nenga nikiva mmonga wa weni. <verse eid="ROM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Munijambusili Pilisika na Akila mngwana ghaki, watumikila wayangu ku Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Weni wayesili hata wajihumisili weni baha kwaikiva gha nenga hata wakalola kulama kwau kwakindu ng'ogha. Tungupalwa kuwashukwile na ng'ogha nenga hela ila hilahila mapinga hyogha yala yamkwinila Kilisito gha wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Munijambusili hilahila lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lila lyeni kungukonganika ukaya kwau Pilisika na Akila. Mnijambusilini na ghanja ghangu Epaineto, hayu awelili mundu wa mtumbulo kumkwinila Kilisito kula Asia. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Munijambusilili Malia, hayu awelili kaghola lihengu kwa kuyangala kwa ikiva gha mwenga. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Munijambusili Andiloniko na Yunia, walongo ghangu wavile wawelili mlighuta lya wawopwa pamonga na nenga. Wandumindumi wanguwamanya nesu hagha wandudumindumi wakola mlima, weni wammanyili Kilisito pambila gha nenga. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Munijambusili Ampiliato, mghanja ghangu nimpalile kwaikiva kakonganika na Bambu. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Hilahila munijambusili Ulibano, mghola lihengu myetu ku Kilisito, pamonga na ghanja ghangu mpalwa Sitakisi. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Munijambusili Apele hayu ayesilwi na akahighilisa kukwinila kwaki ku Kilisito. Muwajambusi wogha weni kuwela ukaya kwa Alisitobulo. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Mnijambusili mlongu ghangu Helodioni. Muwajambusi wamkwinila Kilisito wogha weni kulikala ukaya kwa Nalikisi. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Mnijambusili Tilifaina na Tilifosa, wala wadala wangughola lihengu kwa kuyangala ku Bambu. Mumjambusi ghanja ghangu mpalwa Pelisisi, mdala ghangi agholili lihengu kwa makakala ku Bambu. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Munijambusili Lufo, hayu ni mundu anguyangala nesu kughola lihengu lya Bambu kwa umaha, na nyongo ghaki mweni kuwela handa nyongu ghangu hilahila. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Mnijambusili Asinikilito na Filegoni na Helime na Patiloba na Helima na walongo wogha wamkwinilile Kilisito weni kuwela pamonga na weni. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Mnijambusili Filologo na Yulia na Nelea na mhacha ghaki, Olimpa na wandu wogha wamkwinilile Kilisito wenikuwela pamonga na weni. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Mulijambusi mwenga kwa mwenga kwa kilangihi kya upalo. Wandu wogha wenikumkwinila Kilisito wenikuwela haku wanguwajambusa.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milando gha kuyomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Walongo ghangu, ninguwaluwa nesu mliloleli na kutama kutali na wala wandu weni kuyambusa mikologhanyiko na kubaghula lipinga lya wamkwinila Kilisito kwa kulema kughola kila mvulilwi. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Kwaikiva wandu handa hagha wangumtumikila ng'ogha Bambu Kilisito, ila wangutumikila lumatamata lwao weni baha. Kwa kuwalongela milando pyeku gha uhwangi, wangubyodosa mioyu gha wandu weni kumanya ng'ogha kila kivulwa ni chakaka au uhwangi. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Kila mundu kayoghanila vila mngutundamila Habali Maha, na kwa mghalu hau nenga ninguhekelela. Ningupala muweli na luhala kuvila vya maha, ila mkotoho kuwela wamaha ng'ogha kumighalu mihakata. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Sapanga, mweni kuyegha wandu walikali kwa kuponga, atepondangila Lihyukana na kuwapegha mwenga makakala gha kumsinda. Umaha wa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito na uweli pamonga na mwenga. <verse eid="ROM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoseo, mghola lihengu myangu anguwajambusa. Hilahila Lukio na Yasoni na Sosipatilo, mlongo ghangu wanguwatakila mwenga manemu. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Nenga Telitio, mweni kuyandika lihamba hali handa Paulo anilongilile niyandiki, ninguwajambusa ku Bambu. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayo, avile ni mweni kaya ghangu na wa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lyogha lya ukaya ghaki, anguwajambusa. Elasito, mvika mapesa wa mmbwani hau, pamonga na Kwalito mlongo wa twenga kangi wanguwajambusa. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Umaha wa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito uweli pamonga na mwenga. Hina.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mililando gha kuyomolelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Hinaa tumsifili Sapanga kwaikiva ni mkulu, mweni kuwesa kuwaghola mwenga mgangamali kuukwinila weni kuyegha Habali Maha gha Yesu Kilisito iwelili nikiwatangasila mwenga. Haku dahile Habali Maha hai iwelili mukifisu. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Ila hinaa kifisu haki kigubutulwa na kumanyika kupitila mayandiko gha kilota kwa kukovekelana na selia gha Sapanga wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, lukani wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi wapati kumkwinila na kumyitikila. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Sapanga mweni kuwela weka, mweni luhala, asifilwi kwaikiva gha ukulu ghaki machuwa hyogha bila mwihu kwa kupitila Yesu Kilisito. Hina.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>